<title>AUSTRALIA: CONSENSUS-Australian March quarter GDP forecasts.</title>
<headline>CONSENSUS-Australian March quarter GDP forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are the results of a Reuters survey of economists on final Australian GDP forecasts for the March quarter (s/adj), following the release of quarterly balance of payments data on Friday.</p>
<p>Comparison with previous quarter unless stated.</p>
<p>GDP figures are due out at 0130 GMT on Wednesday.</p>
